{"n":50,"name":"Qaf","nameAr":"ق","meaning":"The Letter \"Qaf\"","ayahs":45,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":26,"ar":"قٓ ۚ وَٱلْقُرْءَانِ ٱلْمَجِيدِ","en":"Qāf. By the honored Qur’ān...","w":[{"ar":"قٓ ۚ","tr":"qaf","en":"Qaf"},{"ar":"وَٱلْقُرْءَانِ","tr":"wal-qur'āni","en":"By the Quran","root":"قرأ","lem":"قُرْءان"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَجِيدِ","tr":"l-majīdi","en":"the Glorious","root":"مجد","lem":"مَجِيد"}]},{"n":2,"juz":26,"ar":"بَلْ عَجِبُوٓا۟ أَن جَآءَهُم مُّنذِرٌ مِّنْهُمْ فَقَالَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ هَـٰذَا شَىْءٌ عَجِيبٌ","en":"But they wonder that there has come to them a warner from among themselves, and the disbelievers say, \"This is an amazing thing.","w":[{"ar":"بَلْ","tr":"bal","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"عَجِبُوٓا۟","tr":"ʿajibū","en":"they wonder","root":"عجب","lem":"عَجِبُ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"جَآءَهُم","tr":"jāahum","en":"has come to them","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"مُّنذِرٌۭ","tr":"mundhirun","en":"a warner","root":"نذر","lem":"مُنذِر"},{"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","tr":"min'hum","en":"from them"},{"ar":"فَقَالَ","tr":"faqāla","en":"So say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","tr":"l-kāfirūna","en":"the disbelievers","root":"كفر","lem":"كافِر"},{"ar":"هَـٰذَا","tr":"hādhā","en":"This"},{"ar":"شَىْءٌ","tr":"shayon","en":"(is) a thing","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"عَجِيبٌ","tr":"ʿajībun","en":"amazing","root":"عجب","lem":"عَجِيب"}]},{"n":3,"juz":26,"ar":"أَءِذَا مِتْنَا وَكُنَّا تُرَابًا ۖ ذَٰلِكَ رَجْعٌۢ بَعِيدٌ","en":"When we have died and have become dust, [we will return to life]? That is a distant [i.e., unlikely] return.\"","w":[{"ar":"أَءِذَا","tr":"a-idhā","en":"What! When"},{"ar":"مِتْنَا","tr":"mit'nā","en":"we die","root":"موت","lem":"ماتَ"},{"ar":"وَكُنَّا","tr":"wakunnā","en":"and have become","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"تُرَابًۭا ۖ","tr":"turāban","en":"dust","root":"ترب","lem":"تُراب"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That"},{"ar":"رَجْعٌۢ","tr":"rajʿun","en":"(is) a return","root":"رجع","lem":"رَجْع"},{"ar":"بَعِيدٌۭ","tr":"baʿīdun","en":"far","root":"بعد","lem":"بَعِيد"}]},{"n":4,"juz":26,"ar":"قَدْ عَلِمْنَا مَا تَنقُصُ ٱلْأَرْضُ مِنْهُمْ ۖ وَعِندَنَا كِتَـٰبٌ حَفِيظٌۢ","en":"We know what the earth diminishes [i.e., consumes] of them, and with Us is a retaining record.","w":[{"ar":"قَدْ","tr":"qad","en":"Certainly"},{"ar":"عَلِمْنَا","tr":"ʿalim'nā","en":"We know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"تَنقُصُ","tr":"tanquṣu","en":"diminishes","root":"نقص","lem":"يُنقَصُ"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","tr":"l-arḍu","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"مِنْهُمْ ۖ","tr":"min'hum","en":"of them"},{"ar":"وَعِندَنَا","tr":"waʿindanā","en":"and with Us","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"كِتَـٰبٌ","tr":"kitābun","en":"(is) a Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"حَفِيظٌۢ","tr":"ḥafīẓun","en":"guarded","root":"حفظ","lem":"حَفِيظ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":26,"ar":"بَلْ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِٱلْحَقِّ لَمَّا جَآءَهُمْ فَهُمْ فِىٓ أَمْرٍ مَّرِيجٍ","en":"But they denied the truth when it came to them, so they are in a confused condition.","w":[{"ar":"بَلْ","tr":"bal","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","tr":"kadhabū","en":"they denied","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","tr":"bil-ḥaqi","en":"the truth","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقّ"},{"ar":"لَمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"when"},{"ar":"جَآءَهُمْ","tr":"jāahum","en":"it came (to) them","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"فَهُمْ","tr":"fahum","en":"so they"},{"ar":"فِىٓ","tr":"fī","en":"(are) in"},{"ar":"أَمْرٍۢ","tr":"amrin","en":"a state","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"مَّرِيجٍ","tr":"marījin","en":"confused","root":"مرج","lem":"مَرِيج"}]},{"n":6,"juz":26,"ar":"أَفَلَمْ يَنظُرُوٓا۟ إِلَى ٱلسَّمَآءِ فَوْقَهُمْ كَيْفَ بَنَيْنَـٰهَا وَزَيَّنَّـٰهَا وَمَا لَهَا مِن فُرُوجٍ","en":"Have they not looked at the heaven above them - how We structured it and adorned it and [how] it has no rifts?","w":[{"ar":"أَفَلَمْ","tr":"afalam","en":"Then do not"},{"ar":"يَنظُرُوٓا۟","tr":"yanẓurū","en":"they look","root":"نظر","lem":"نَظَرَ"},{"ar":"إِلَى","tr":"ilā","en":"at"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"l-samāi","en":"the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"فَوْقَهُمْ","tr":"fawqahum","en":"above them ","root":"فوق","lem":"فَوْق"},{"ar":"كَيْفَ","tr":"kayfa","en":"how","root":"كيف","lem":"كَيْف"},{"ar":"بَنَيْنَـٰهَا","tr":"banaynāhā","en":"We structured it","root":"بني","lem":"بَنَى"},{"ar":"وَزَيَّنَّـٰهَا","tr":"wazayyannāhā","en":"and adorned it","root":"زين","lem":"زَيَّنَ"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"لَهَا","tr":"lahā","en":"for it"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"any"},{"ar":"فُرُوجٍۢ","tr":"furūjin","en":"rifts","root":"فرج","lem":"فَرْج"}]},{"n":7,"juz":26,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ مَدَدْنَـٰهَا وَأَلْقَيْنَا فِيهَا رَوَٰسِىَ وَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ زَوْجٍۭ بَهِيجٍ","en":"And the earth - We spread it out and cast therein firmly set mountains and made grow therein [something] of every beautiful kind,","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","tr":"wal-arḍa","en":"And the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"مَدَدْنَـٰهَا","tr":"madadnāhā","en":"We have spread it out","root":"مدد","lem":"مَدَّ"},{"ar":"وَأَلْقَيْنَا","tr":"wa-alqaynā","en":"and cast","root":"لقي","lem":"أَلْقَى"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"therein"},{"ar":"رَوَٰسِىَ","tr":"rawāsiya","en":"firmly set mountains","root":"رسو","lem":"رَواسِي"},{"ar":"وَأَنۢبَتْنَا","tr":"wa-anbatnā","en":"and We made to grow","root":"نبت","lem":"أَنۢبَتَ"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"therein"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"كُلِّ","tr":"kulli","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"زَوْجٍۭ","tr":"zawjin","en":"kind","root":"زوج","lem":"زَوْج"},{"ar":"بَهِيجٍۢ","tr":"bahījin","en":"beautiful","root":"بهج","lem":"بَهِيج"}]},{"n":8,"juz":26,"ar":"تَبْصِرَةً وَذِكْرَىٰ لِكُلِّ عَبْدٍ مُّنِيبٍ","en":"Giving insight and a reminder for every servant who turns [to Allāh].","w":[{"ar":"تَبْصِرَةًۭ","tr":"tabṣiratan","en":"Giving insight","root":"بصر","lem":"تَبْصِرَة"},{"ar":"وَ