 Thus is the emergence [i.e., resurrection].","w":[{"ar":"رِّزْقًۭا","tr":"riz'qan","en":"A provision","root":"رزق","lem":"رِزْق"},{"ar":"لِّلْعِبَادِ ۖ","tr":"lil'ʿibādi","en":"for the slaves","root":"عبد","lem":"عَبْد"},{"ar":"وَأَحْيَيْنَا","tr":"wa-aḥyaynā","en":"and We give life","root":"حيي","lem":"أَحْيا"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ","tr":"bihi","en":"therewith"},{"ar":"بَلْدَةًۭ","tr":"baldatan","en":"(to) a land","root":"بلد","lem":"بَلْدَة"},{"ar":"مَّيْتًۭا ۚ","tr":"maytan","en":"dead","root":"موت","lem":"مَيْت"},{"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","tr":"kadhālika","en":"Thus"},{"ar":"ٱلْخُرُوجُ","tr":"l-khurūju","en":"(will be) the coming forth","root":"خرج","lem":"خُرُوج"}]},{"n":12,"juz":26,"ar":"كَذَّبَتْ قَبْلَهُمْ قَوْمُ نُوحٍ وَأَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلرَّسِّ وَثَمُودُ","en":"The people of Noah denied before them, and the companions of the well and Thamūd","w":[{"ar":"كَذَّبَتْ","tr":"kadhabat","en":"Denied","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"قَبْلَهُمْ","tr":"qablahum","en":"before them","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"قَوْمُ","tr":"qawmu","en":"(the) people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"نُوحٍۢ","tr":"nūḥin","en":"(of) Nuh"},{"ar":"وَأَصْحَـٰبُ","tr":"wa-aṣḥābu","en":"and (the) companions","root":"صحب","lem":"أَصْحاب"},{"ar":"ٱلرَّسِّ","tr":"l-rasi","en":"(of) Ar-Raas","root":"رسس","lem":"رَسّ"},{"ar":"وَثَمُودُ","tr":"wathamūdu","en":"and Thamud"}]},{"n":13,"juz":26,"ar":"وَعَادٌ وَفِرْعَوْنُ وَإِخْوَٰنُ لُوطٍ","en":"And ʿAad and Pharaoh and the brothers [i.e., people] of Lot","w":[{"ar":"وَعَادٌۭ","tr":"waʿādun","en":"And Aad","root":"عود","lem":"عاد"},{"ar":"وَفِرْعَوْنُ","tr":"wafir'ʿawnu","en":"and Firaun"},{"ar":"وَإِخْوَٰنُ","tr":"wa-ikh'wānu","en":"and (the) brothers","root":"أخو","lem":"أَخ"},{"ar":"لُوطٍۢ","tr":"lūṭin","en":"(of) Lut"}]},{"n":14,"juz":26,"ar":"وَأَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْأَيْكَةِ وَقَوْمُ تُبَّعٍ ۚ كُلٌّ كَذَّبَ ٱلرُّسُلَ فَحَقَّ وَعِيدِ","en":"And the companions of the thicket and the people of Tubbaʿ. All denied the messengers, so My threat was justly fulfilled.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَصْحَـٰبُ","tr":"wa-aṣḥābu","en":"And (the) companions","root":"صحب","lem":"أَصْحاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَيْكَةِ","tr":"l-aykati","en":"(of) the wood"},{"ar":"وَقَوْمُ","tr":"waqawmu","en":"and (the) people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"تُبَّعٍۢ ۚ","tr":"tubbaʿin","en":"(of) Tubba"},{"ar":"كُلٌّۭ","tr":"kullun","en":"All","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"كَذَّبَ","tr":"kadhaba","en":"denied","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"ٱلرُّسُلَ","tr":"l-rusula","en":"the Messengers","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"فَحَقَّ","tr":"faḥaqqa","en":"so was fulfilled","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقَّ"},{"ar":"وَعِيدِ","tr":"waʿīdi","en":"My Threat","root":"وعد","lem":"وَعِيد"}]},{"n":15,"juz":26,"ar":"أَفَعَيِينَا بِٱلْخَلْقِ ٱلْأَوَّلِ ۚ بَلْ هُمْ فِى لَبْسٍ مِّنْ خَلْقٍ جَدِيدٍ","en":"Did We fail in the first creation? But they are in confusion over a new creation.","w":[{"ar":"أَفَعَيِينَا","tr":"afaʿayīnā","en":"Were We then tired","root":"عيي","lem":"عَيِي"},{"ar":"بِٱلْخَلْقِ","tr":"bil-khalqi","en":"with the creation","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلْق"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلِ ۚ","tr":"l-awali","en":"the first","root":"أول","lem":"أَوَّل"},{"ar":"بَلْ","tr":"bal","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"هُمْ","tr":"hum","en":"they"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(are) in"},{"ar":"لَبْسٍۢ","tr":"labsin","en":"doubt","root":"لبس","lem":"لَبْس"},{"ar":"مِّنْ","tr":"min","en":"about"},{"ar":"خَلْقٍۢ","tr":"khalqin","en":"a creation","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلْق"},{"ar":"جَدِيدٍۢ","tr":"jadīdin","en":"new","root":"جدد","lem":"جَدِيد"}]},{"n":16,"juz":26,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ وَنَعْلَمُ مَا تُوَسْوِسُ بِهِۦ نَفْسُهُۥ ۖ وَنَحْنُ أَقْرَبُ إِلَيْهِ مِنْ حَبْلِ ٱلْوَرِيدِ","en":"And We have already created man and know what his soul whispers to him, and We are closer to him than [his] jugular vein.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","tr":"walaqad","en":"And certainly"},{"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","tr":"khalaqnā","en":"We created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","tr":"l-insāna","en":"man","root":"أنس