:"(is) an observer","root":"رقب","lem":"رَقِيب"},{"ar":"عَتِيدٌۭ","tr":"ʿatīdun","en":"ready","root":"عتد","lem":"عَتِيد"}]},{"n":19,"juz":26,"ar":"وَجَآءَتْ سَكْرَةُ ٱلْمَوْتِ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ ذَٰلِكَ مَا كُنتَ مِنْهُ تَحِيدُ","en":"And the intoxication of death will bring the truth; that is what you were trying to avoid.","w":[{"ar":"وَجَآءَتْ","tr":"wajāat","en":"And will come","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"سَكْرَةُ","tr":"sakratu","en":"(the) stupor","root":"سكر","lem":"سَكْرَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتِ","tr":"l-mawti","en":"(of) death","root":"موت","lem":"مَوْت"},{"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","tr":"bil-ḥaqi","en":"in truth","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقّ"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"(is) what"},{"ar":"كُنتَ","tr":"kunta","en":"you were","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مِنْهُ","tr":"min'hu","en":"[from it]"},{"ar":"تَحِيدُ","tr":"taḥīdu","en":"avoiding","root":"حيد","lem":"تَحِيدُ"}]},{"n":20,"juz":26,"ar":"وَنُفِخَ فِى ٱلصُّورِ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ يَوْمُ ٱلْوَعِيدِ","en":"And the Horn will be blown. That is the Day of [carrying out] the threat.","w":[{"ar":"وَنُفِخَ","tr":"wanufikha","en":"And will be blown","root":"نفخ","lem":"نَفَخَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"[in]"},{"ar":"ٱلصُّورِ ۚ","tr":"l-ṣūri","en":"the trumpet","root":"صور","lem":"صُور"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That"},{"ar":"يَوْمُ","tr":"yawmu","en":"(is the) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلْوَعِيدِ","tr":"l-waʿīdi","en":"(of) the Warning","root":"وعد","lem":"وَعِيد"}]},{"n":21,"juz":26,"ar":"وَجَآءَتْ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ مَّعَهَا سَآئِقٌ وَشَهِيدٌ","en":"And every soul will come, with it a driver and a witness.","w":[{"ar":"وَجَآءَتْ","tr":"wajāat","en":"And will come","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"كُلُّ","tr":"kullu","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","tr":"nafsin","en":"soul","root":"نفس","lem":"نَفْس"},{"ar":"مَّعَهَا","tr":"maʿahā","en":"with it"},{"ar":"سَآئِقٌۭ","tr":"sāiqun","en":"a driver","root":"سوق","lem":"سائِق"},{"ar":"وَشَه