ly create the heavens and earth and what is between them in six days, and there touched Us no weariness.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","tr":"walaqad","en":"And certainly"},{"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","tr":"khalaqnā","en":"We created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","tr":"wal-arḍa","en":"and the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and whatever"},{"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَا","tr":"baynahumā","en":"(is) between both of them","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"سِتَّةِ","tr":"sittati","en":"six","root":"ستت","lem":"سِتَّة"},{"ar":"أَيَّامٍۢ","tr":"ayyāmin","en":"periods","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and (did) not"},{"ar":"مَسَّنَا","tr":"massanā","en":"touch Us","root":"مسس","lem":"مَسَّ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"any"},{"ar":"لُّغُوبٍۢ","tr":"lughūbin","en":"fatigue","root":"لغب","lem":"لُغُوب"}]},{"n":39,"juz":26,"ar":"فَٱصْبِرْ عَلَىٰ مَا يَقُولُونَ وَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّكَ قَبْلَ طُلُوعِ ٱلشَّمْسِ وَقَبْلَ ٱلْغُرُوبِ","en":"So be patient, [O Muḥammad], over what they say and exalt [Allāh] with praise of your Lord before the rising of the sun and before its setting,","w":[{"ar":"فَٱصْبِرْ","tr":"fa-iṣ'bir","en":"So be patient","root":"صبر","lem":"صَبَرَ"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"over"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","tr":"yaqūlūna","en":"they say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"وَسَبِّحْ","tr":"wasabbiḥ","en":"and glorify","root":"سبح","lem":"سَبَّحَ"},{"ar":"بِحَمْدِ","tr":"biḥamdi","en":"(the) praise","root":"حمد","lem":"حَمْد"},{"ar":"رَبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"(of) your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"قَبْلَ","tr":"qabla","en":"before","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"طُلُوعِ","tr":"ṭulūʿi","en":"(the) rising","root":"طلع","lem":"طُلُوع"},{"ar":"ٱلشَّمْسِ","tr":"l-shamsi","en":"(of) the sun","root":"شمس","lem":"شَمْس"},{"ar":"وَقَبْلَ","tr":"waqabla","en":"and before","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"ٱلْغُرُوبِ","tr":"l-ghurūbi","en":"the setting","root":"غرب","lem":"غُرُوب"}]},{"n":40,"juz":26,"ar":"وَمِنَ ٱلَّيْلِ فَسَبِّحْهُ وَأَدْبَـٰرَ ٱلسُّجُودِ","en":"And [in part] of the night exalt Him and after prostration [i.e., prayer].","w":[{"ar":"وَمِنَ","tr":"wamina","en":"And of"},{"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","tr":"al-layli","en":"the night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْل"},{"ar":"فَسَبِّحْهُ","tr":"fasabbiḥ'hu","en":"glorify Him","root":"سبح","lem":"سَبَّحَ"},{"ar":"وَأَدْبَـٰرَ","tr":"wa-adbāra","en":"and after","root":"دبر","lem":"دُبُر"},{"ar":"ٱلسُّجُودِ","tr":"l-sujūdi","en":"the prostration","root":"سجد","lem":"سُجُود"}]},{"n":41,"juz":26,"ar":"وَٱسْتَمِعْ يَوْمَ يُنَادِ ٱلْمُنَادِ مِن مَّكَانٍ قَرِيبٍ","en":"And listen on the Day when the Caller will call out from a place that is near -","w":[{"ar":"وَٱسْتَمِعْ","tr":"wa-is'tamiʿ","en":"And listen","root":"سمع","lem":"اسْتَمَعَ"},{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(The) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"يُنَادِ","tr":"yunādi","en":"will call","root":"ندي","lem":"نادَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُنَادِ","tr":"l-munādi","en":"the caller","root":"ندي","lem":"مُناد"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"مَّكَانٍۢ","tr":"makānin","en":"a place","root":"كون","lem":"مَكان"},{"ar":"قَرِيبٍۢ","tr":"qarībin","en":"near","root":"قرب","lem":"قَرِيب"}]},{"n":42,"juz":26,"ar":"يَوْمَ يَسْمَعُونَ ٱلصَّيْحَةَ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ يَوْمُ ٱلْخُرُوجِ","en":"The Day they will hear the blast [of the Horn] in truth. That is the Day of Emergence [from the graves].","w":[{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(The) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"يَسْمَعُونَ","tr":"yasmaʿūna","en":"they will hear","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"ٱلصَّيْحَةَ","tr":"l-ṣayḥata","en":"the Blast","root":"صيح","lem":"صَيْحَة"},{"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","tr":"bil-ḥaqi","en":"in truth","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقّ"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That"},{"ar":"يَوْمُ","tr":"yawmu","en":"(is the) Day","roo